if {CKP.RebeccaHasSpoken} == true:
	CKP_Rebecca: Yes?
else:
	CKP_Rebecca: Who, me?
label Questions
- Did you see me last night?
	Devin: What can you tell me about last night?
	CKP_Rebecca: Nowt, hunter. Did you see me perform?
	Devin: You’re a performer?
	CKP_Rebecca: Only after enough liquid courage. And last night, I had plenty.
	jump Questions
- Were can I find Buckley?
	Devin: Have you seen the mayor?
	CKP_Rebecca: Buckley? Nay.
	Devin: Any notion where he is?
	CKP_Rebecca: Nowt, I am afraid.
	jump Questions
- Fare thee well.
	CKP_Rebecca: Perhaps next time you could see me perform?
	Devin: If I find myself here, and if you find yourself some more gin, then I imagine so.
	if {CKP.NumSetRebecca} == false:
		set {Silas.5BTalked} += 1
		set {CKP.NumSetRebecca} = true
	set {CKP.RebeccaHasSpoken} = true
	[end_timeline]
